                        "entry_id": "630a0a8e-42aa-315b-8223-a769742edf8a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A Jew bound by a vow to leave the hair uncut, to abstain from alcohol, and to practice extraordinary purity of life and devotion."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
